            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.265,
            0.43,
            0.284
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、名词解释（每个3分，共30分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.286,
            0.938,
            0.326
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.056,
                0.286,
                0.938,
                0.305
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. Replication fork; 2. 一碳单位; 3. RNA 编辑; 4. Mismatch repair; 5. 中心法则;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.056,
                0.307,
                0.917,
                0.326
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. DNA 变性和复性；7. Active site；8. 同工酶；9. 多核糖体；10. chaperone。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.328,
            0.274,
            0.347
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、问答题（120 分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.349,
            0.94,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1、血红蛋白的天然变种几达 500 余种。大多数变种是  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  链的单氨基酸突变。有些变种产生临床疾病，尽管不是所有变种都有害。下面就是其中的一些变种:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.391,
            0.692,
            0.41
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "HbS(sickle-cell H b): 分子表面的一个 Glu 被一个 Val 取代。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.413,
            0.6,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Cowtown: 减少了一个参与 T 稳定态的一个离子对。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.433,
            0.899,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Memphis: 表面上的一个不带电的极性基团被另一个相似不带电的极性基团取代。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.455,
            0.589,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Bibba: 在一个  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -螺旋中的一个 Leu 被 Pro 取代。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.476,
            0.577,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Milwaukee: 分子中的一个 Val 被一个 Glu 取代。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.497,
            0.795,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Providence: 一个正常情况下伸出四聚体中央腔穴的 Lys 被 Asn 取代。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.519,
            0.606,
            0.539
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hb Philly: Tyr 被 Phe 取代，打破了  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha_{1}\\beta_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  界面的氢键。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.543,
            0.411,
            0.561
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "解释下面你的每一个选择（6 分）:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.563,
            0.842,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.06,
                0.564,
                0.405,
                0.582
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(1) 最不可能引起病理症状的变种。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.06,
                0.585,
                0.6,
                0.604
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(2)在跑 IEF 时最有可能表现出与 HbA 不同 pI 的变种。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.06,
                0.606,
                0.842,
                0.625
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(3)最有可能表现出降低与BPG的结合能力，增加血红蛋白对氧亲和力的变种。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.627,
            0.761,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2、以下列 DNA 片断为模板，F1: 3' —ATACAGTCGAGCACTGATCAC—5'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.366,
            0.648,
            0.772,
            0.666
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "F2: 5' —TATGTCAGCTCGTGACTAGTG—3'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.669,
            0.385,
            0.688
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "箭头方向（每个2分，共10分）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.691,
            0.943,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 27,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.691,
                0.569,
                0.709
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "a) 若箭头表示复制方向，则哪条链为前导链？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 28,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.712,
                0.678,
                0.73
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "b) 若复制该 DNA，反应体系中至少需要哪些反应物参加？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 29,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.733,
                0.569,
                0.751
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "c) 若箭头表示转录方向，则哪条链为模板链？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 30,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.754,
                0.748,
                0.773
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "d) 如以该模板合成 RNA，反应体系中至少需要哪些反应物参加？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 31,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.775,
                0.942,
                0.814
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "e）写出由它复制、转录及翻译的产物，并注明各产物的两端（5’、3’、N 端、C 端）"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.817,
            0.942,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "密码表: UAU 酪 CAG 谷氨酰胺 AUG 蛋 GUC 缬 UGU 半胱 CUC 亮 AGC 丝 GCU 丙 UCA 丝 CGU 精 ACU 苏 GUG 缬 UCG 丝 CUA 亮 AGU 丝 GAC 天冬"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
